Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_label","html":"opening definitions of §3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>104</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>115</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-and-signature-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T\">\\(T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NC}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{NC}_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dd5d746ea1792bf7\" href=\"?note=dd5d746ea1792bf7\" title=\"67-df-degree-cupping-capping\">67-df-degree-cupping-capping</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in D_T\">\\(a\\in D_T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{High}_T,\\mathrm{Low}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{High}_T,\\mathrm{Low}_T\\)</span> 是下式定义的一元谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{High}_T(a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{NC}_T(\\mathbf0_T,a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{High}_T(a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{NC}_T(\\mathbf0_T,a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Low}_T(a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg\\mathrm{High}_T(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Low}_T(a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg\\mathrm{High}_T(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书印刷104页/PDF115页 high iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\gg\\mathbf0_T\">\\(a\\gg\\mathbf0_T\\)</span>，low otherwise。此处的 high/low 属于解释度格，不能与 Turing 度的同名性质混用。依定义底度为 low，顶度为 high；定义没有暗中排除这两个端点。来源还由引理7给出 low 与存在非顶 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 上界的等价刻画，此等价另列在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"53ac2709b362624c\" href=\"?note=53ac2709b362624c\" title=\"67-thm-degree-class-cofinality\">67-thm-degree-class-cofinality</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-cupping-capping","status":"resolved","id":"dd5d746ea1792bf7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-cupping-capping]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\mathrm{NC}_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-cupping-capping]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-cupping-capping","status":"resolved","id":"dd5d746ea1792bf7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\mathrm{NC}_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-cupping-capping]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-degree-class-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"53ac2709b362624c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"对应原书印刷104页/PDF115页 high iff $a\\gg\\mathbf0_T$，low otherwise。此处的 high/low 属于解释度格，不能与 Turing 度的同名性质混用。依定义底度为 low，顶度为 high；定义没有暗中排除这两个端点。来源还由引理7给出 low 与存在非顶 $\\Sigma_1$ 上界的等价刻画，此等价另列在 [[67-thm-degree-class-cofinality]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NC}_T","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in D_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{High}_T,\\mathrm{Low}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{High}_T(a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{NC}_T(\\mathbf0_T,a).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Low}_T(a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg\\mathrm{High}_T(a).","display":true},{"tex":"a\\gg\\mathbf0_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false}],"bytes":1643,"backlinks":[{"id":"53ac2709b362624c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-complexity]]；$\\mathrm{Low}_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-high-low]]；$\\mathrm{Cofinal}_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-cofinality]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-degree-high-low]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-degree-high-low]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]；[[../67-thm-degree-splitting-density]]；[[../67-df-degree-complexity]]；[[../67-thm-degree-delta2]]；[[../67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]]；[[../67-df-degree-cupping-capping]]；[[../67-df-degree-high-low]]；[[../67-df-degree-reduction-principle]]；[[../67-thm-degree-infinitary-distributivity]]；[[../67-thm-degree-finite-generation-gap]]"}],"outgoing":["dd5d746ea1792bf7","f5b9611e728efd8b","53ac2709b362624c"]}